Z||000000||FLASHY||07-30-2001||09:10 PM||||I was wasting time just now on Photoshop and thought this would be cool if you were 5' nothing, no speed bumps or pot holes to worry about, and you didn't have to steer. Other than that I wouldn't mind having my fiero look like this. If they have a Fast and Furious Part II they should have one of these in there. He he I know I have too much time on my hands.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/too_low1.jpg"> <P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/flashy_sig.gif"> <P>"I know you believe you understand what you think I wrote, but I'm not sure you realize that what you read is not what I really meant"||||reg||7
